{'symbol': 'PWR', 'date': '2019-10-09 22:30:00', 'title': 'Quanta Services, Inc. Announces Appointment of Martha B. Wyrsch to its Board of Directors', 'text': "Quanta Services, Inc. announced the appointment of Martha B. Wyrsch to the company's Board of Directors. Ms. Wyrsch brings extensive experience from the utility and energy industry to Quanta's board. Ms. Wyrsch, 61, brings wide-ranging executive-level experience in the utility and energy industry, including extensive operational, management and legal expertise. She previously served as Executive Vice President and General Counsel of Sempra Energy, an energy infrastructure and services company with operations in the United States and internationally, from September 2013 until March 2019, where she oversaw legal and compliance matters, and as President – North America of Vestas American Wind Technology."}
{'symbol': 'RJF', 'date': '2019-10-09 22:30:00', 'title': 'MainFirst Bank AG cancelled the acquisition of European equities institutional brokerage business from Raymond James Financial, Inc.', 'text': 'MainFirst Bank AG agreed to acquire the European equities institutional brokerage business from Raymond James Financial, Inc., on October 9, 2018. These European businesses are based in Paris and London. As part of this acquisition, MainFirst will also add 29 employees from Raymond James in Paris including Research, Sales and Sales Trading and a further six Research employees in London. These individuals will be integrated into the MainFirst organization. The transaction is expected to complete on December 1, 2018.\nMainFirst Bank AG cancelled the acquisition of European equities institutional brokerage business from Raymond James Financial, Inc., on October 9, 2019. \n'}
